{"version": "read-v32", "corpus_chars": 120581, "corpus_path": "/Users/arrieta/Obsidian/Research/Claude/rPlace/Layer A/50_coding_runs/yard_v30/_lead_sessions/GrowTheTree-gpt56-calibration-v1/workspace/room/run/corpus.txt", "header": [0, 9208], "threads": [{"tid": "62vhhm", "n": 1, "items": 2, "chars": 240, "words": 43, "title": "Rough ideas for expansion. Grow the roots, grow the branches, grow the leaves!", "head": [9286, 9418], "body": [9496, 9869], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vj6e", "n": 2, "items": 1, "chars": 89, "words": 14, "title": "Rough ideas for expansion. Grow the roots, grow the branches, grow the leaves!", "head": [9947, 10078], "body": [10156, 10340], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vjy4", "n": 3, "items": 1, "chars": 108, "words": 19, "title": "Rough ideas for expansion. The Finnish flag has to go I think... they already have a larger one!!", "head": [10418, 10569], "body": [10647, 10850], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vkju", "n": 4, "items": 1, "chars": 105, "words": 19, "title": "Trees are flexible and resilient and their nature is to adapt and grow", "head": [10928, 11052], "body": [11130, 11287], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vonn", "n": 5, "items": 2, "chars": 94, "words": 18, "title": "Yggdrasil, the world tree", "head": [11365, 11443], "body": [11521, 11827], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vris", "n": 6, "items": 3, "chars": 156, "words": 30, "title": "Its time to fight the void!", "head": [11905, 11986], "body": [12064, 12366], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62vw7k", "n": 7, "items": 2, "chars": 249, "words": 48, "title": "we should avoid using black, it gives the void a foothold they do not need", "head": [12444, 12572], "body": [12650, 12997], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62w4ad", "n": 8, "items": 4, "chars": 462, "words": 62, "title": "Strategy: Replace black with brown, expand to the right", "head": [13075, 13184], "body": [13262, 13921], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62w69o", "n": 9, "items": 7, "chars": 1112, "words": 186, "title": "can the baby tree get some love?", "head": [13999, 14087], "body": [14165, 15642], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62wb12", "n": 10, "items": 3, "chars": 644, "words": 82, "title": "reach out to other arborists", "head": [15720, 15803], "body": [15881, 16665], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62wfc5", "n": 11, "items": 3, "chars": 357, "words": 44, "title": "if rainbowroad starts going through us we should build with them, not against", "head": [16743, 16875], "body": [16953, 17453], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62wgcb", "n": 12, "items": 2, "chars": 366, "words": 71, "title": "Sign someone wants to put over the baby tree. Are we open to it being \"the IUP tree\" if it's still green and growing?", "head": [17531, 17703], "body": [17781, 18335], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62wgvv", "n": 13, "items": 4, "chars": 322, "words": 58, "title": "REPLACE ALL BLACK WITH PURPLE", "head": [18413, 18497], "body": [18575, 19107], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62wku9", "n": 14, "items": 7, "chars": 1355, "words": 237, "title": "Hey guys I'm here to make a deal.", "head": [19185, 19891], "body": [19969, 21652], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62wlxu", "n": 15, "items": 4, "chars": 303, "words": 56, "title": "What do we do if the void takes over the tree?", "head": [21730, 21831], "body": [21909, 22410], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62x4q8", "n": 16, "items": 7, "chars": 662, "words": 103, "title": "We have permission from a /r/ainbow mod to round out the tree where it meets their border (but fix Void damage first!)", "head": [22488, 23279], "body": [23357, 24404], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62x85f", "n": 17, "items": 1, "chars": 86, "words": 14, "title": "Does anybody know what the red horizontal line is cutting through the tree?", "head": [24482, 24611], "body": [24689, 24824], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62x950", "n": 18, "items": 12, "chars": 890, "words": 127, "title": "All hands on deck! /r/AmericanFlaginPlace/ is trying to build over the tree!", "head": [24902, 25035], "body": [25113, 26625], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62xg4k", "n": 19, "items": 3, "chars": 185, "words": 36, "title": "Looks like this is the end of the tree :(", "head": [26703, 26799], "body": [26877, 27271], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62xm2g", "n": 20, "items": 8, "chars": 583, "words": 114, "title": "We hereby have an agreement with the American Flag", "head": [27349, 28072], "body": [28150, 29145], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62xsln", "n": 21, "items": 7, "chars": 1806, "words": 180, "title": "We should make a new big tree!", "head": [29223, 29310], "body": [29388, 31554], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62xsnb", "n": 22, "items": 13, "chars": 1312, "words": 226, "title": "The American Flag has consumed us. Don't worry! Lets build up that sapling into our new tree", "head": [31632, 32399], "body": [32477, 34472], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62xttj", "n": 23, "items": 1, "chars": 278, "words": 56, "title": "What direction should we go now?", "head": [34550, 34637], "body": [34715, 35045], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62xvl0", "n": 24, "items": 8, "chars": 1588, "words": 303, "title": "Possible mock up of new tree?", "head": [35123, 35826], "body": [35904, 37934], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62y0o1", "n": 25, "items": 9, "chars": 969, "words": 157, "title": "Respect the butterfly people!", "head": [38012, 38714], "body": [38792, 40214], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62y4iq", "n": 26, "items": 7, "chars": 936, "words": 160, "title": "On behalf of The American Flag I apologize for the ruthless destruction of your tree.", "head": [40292, 40433], "body": [40511, 41806], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62y6eg", "n": 27, "items": 13, "chars": 1822, "words": 288, "title": "Newest possible mock up? (Forgot shading)", "head": [41884, 42600], "body": [42678, 45198], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62z4jf", "n": 28, "items": 7, "chars": 771, "words": 138, "title": "/r/Straya's hivemind is jumping the gun on a project that overwrites us. Negotations are in progress. Protect the foliage.", "head": [45276, 46071], "body": [46149, 47236], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "630dhp", "n": 29, "items": 21, "chars": 4774, "words": 687, "title": "April 2 priorities", "head": [47314, 48008], "body": [48086, 53929], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "6314v3", "n": 30, "items": 3, "chars": 826, "words": 144, "title": "opportunities.", "head": [54007, 54077], "body": [54155, 55139], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "631cyh", "n": 31, "items": 9, "chars": 1170, "words": 214, "title": "Grow the leaves, grow the forest, not outline", "head": [55217, 55319], "body": [55397, 57063], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "631du1", "n": 32, "items": 25, "chars": 5058, "words": 843, "title": "Cleanup proposal guide (before/after) - April 2", "head": [57141, 57864], "body": [57942, 64344], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "631lwh", "n": 33, "items": 4, "chars": 1146, "words": 162, "title": "we're still under attack by the usa.", "head": [64422, 64515], "body": [64593, 65941], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "631nk3", "n": 34, "items": 1, "chars": 75, "words": 15, "title": "we should try to grow under steve irwin", "head": [66019, 66112], "body": [66190, 66317], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "632ku2", "n": 35, "items": 4, "chars": 494, "words": 93, "title": "Guess I'm with y'all now", "head": [66395, 66474], "body": [66552, 67240], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "632nhs", "n": 36, "items": 10, "chars": 959, "words": 175, "title": "concept: winky eye?", "head": [67318, 67394], "body": [67472, 68976], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "632q60", "n": 37, "items": 2, "chars": 157, "words": 29, "title": "Seems like an official /r/place logo has appeared centered at (575, 488). I suggest we leave it alone for now and focus elsewhere.", "head": [69054, 69239], "body": [69317, 69637], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "6332ws", "n": 38, "items": 8, "chars": 1514, "words": 265, "title": "New neighbors", "head": [69715, 70402], "body": [70480, 72383], "has_window": true}, {"